sequenceDiagram
%% process-key: architecture-decision-governance
    participant role_governance_facilitator as Governance facilitator
    participant role_domain_owner as Domain owner
    participant role_solution_architect as Solution architect
    participant role_product_owner as Product owner
    participant role_security_reviewer as Security reviewer
    participant role_compliance_steward as Compliance steward
    participant role_service_owner as Service owner
    participant system as Architecture decision governance and ADR stewardship
    role_governance_facilitator->>system: Capture architecture decision demand
    system-->>role_governance_facilitator: evidence -> Decision brief, Architecture demand intake
    role_solution_architect->>system: Assemble context, constraints, and options
    system-->>role_solution_architect: evidence -> Architecture decision record, Option comparison brief
    role_security_reviewer->>system: Review security, compliance, and policy impact
    system-->>role_security_reviewer: evidence -> Security review note, Dependency and provenance impact note
    role_governance_facilitator->>system: Make the board decision and record rationale
    system-->>role_governance_facilitator: evidence -> Approved architecture decision record
    Note over system: branches -> Approved, Deferred
    role_solution_architect->>system: Publish rollout guidance and revisit triggers
    system-->>role_solution_architect: evidence -> Architecture rollout guidance, Architecture revisit trigger log
